cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this release and the accompanying manuscript."
type: software
title: "Separable regression tests: PK/PD identification and NIST benchmarks"
version: "1.1.1"
license: "PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mattialaurini/regression-tests"
url: "https://github.com/mattialaurini/regression-tests"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementations and reproduction scripts for separable nonlinear
  regression experiments. The package includes PK/PD identification with
  approximate-likelihood ARX and exact maximum-likelihood models, a six-model
  patient illustration, bounded NIST regression benchmarks comparing
  branch-and-bound with SCIP, and a matched-grid screening ablation.
